    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1488">

                <pb facs="1248" n="1144" xml:id="pg1144"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.00/105.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-08-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 4, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 31. Cable statement of exactly all you have done to prevent violence to
                    the person of ex-President Leguía and his son. The Department desires that you
                    leave undone nothing you can properly do to save the lives of these gentlemen
                    and of the Vice President. Interview the President before reporting.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
